The two operations requests are not included. This node's contract grants only `StateHandle<'seen', read-write>`, and the component has no filesystem or HTTP capability. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need extra imports such as `aap:caps/http-client`, which the node is not granted. Sending the input's text to an outside service would also leak data beyond the node's scope. If you want those behaviours, they have to be added to the node's declared capabilities in the graph first.

